en:
For one variable define $\frac{\partial}{\partial\theta}\alpha=0,
\qquad
\frac{\partial}{\partial\theta}\theta=1,$ so that $\frac{\partial}{\partial\theta}
(\alpha+\beta\theta)=\beta.$ For two variables, choose left derivatives and keep the canonical order $\theta_1\theta_2$: $\begin{aligned}\frac{\partial^L f}{\partial\theta_1}
&=\beta_1+\gamma\theta_2,\\
\frac{\partial^L f}{\partial\theta_2}
&=\beta_2-\gamma\theta_1.\end{aligned}$ The minus sign in the second line arises because the odd derivative must pass through $\theta_1$ before differentiating $\theta_2$.

ja:
一変数のとき、 $\frac{\partial}{\partial\theta}\alpha=0,
\qquad
\frac{\partial}{\partial\theta}\theta=1,$ と定義すると、 $\frac{\partial}{\partial\theta}
(\alpha+\beta\theta)=\beta.$ 二変数のとき、左微分を選び、標準的順序 $\theta_1\theta_2$ を保つ： $\begin{aligned}\frac{\partial^L f}{\partial\theta_1}
&=\beta_1+\gamma\theta_2,\\
\frac{\partial^L f}{\partial\theta_2}
&=\beta_2-\gamma\theta_1.\end{aligned}$ 二行目のマイナス符号は、奇の微分が $\theta_2$ を微分する前に $\theta_1$ を通り抜けなければならないことから生じる。

zh:
对于一个变量，定义 $\frac{\partial}{\partial\theta}\alpha=0,
\qquad
\frac{\partial}{\partial\theta}\theta=1,$ 从而 $\frac{\partial}{\partial\theta}
(\alpha+\beta\theta)=\beta.$ 对于两个变量，选择左导数并保持规范顺序$\theta_1\theta_2$： $\begin{aligned}\frac{\partial^L f}{\partial\theta_1}
&=\beta_1+\gamma\theta_2,\\
\frac{\partial^L f}{\partial\theta_2}
&=\beta_2-\gamma\theta_1.\end{aligned}$ 第二行中的负号出现，是因为奇导数必须先穿过$\theta_1$，然后才能对$\theta_2$求导。

es:
Para una variable, definamos $\frac{\partial}{\partial\theta}\alpha=0,
\qquad
\frac{\partial}{\partial\theta}\theta=1,$ de modo que $\frac{\partial}{\partial\theta}
(\alpha+\beta\theta)=\beta.$ Para dos variables, elijamos derivadas por la izquierda y conservemos el orden canónico $\theta_1\theta_2$: $\begin{aligned}\frac{\partial^L f}{\partial\theta_1}
&=\beta_1+\gamma\theta_2,\\
\frac{\partial^L f}{\partial\theta_2}
&=\beta_2-\gamma\theta_1.\end{aligned}$ El signo menos de la segunda línea aparece porque la derivada impar debe pasar por $\theta_1$ antes de derivar respecto de $\theta_2$.

de:
Für eine Variable definiert man $\frac{\partial}{\partial\theta}\alpha=0,
\qquad
\frac{\partial}{\partial\theta}\theta=1,$ sodass $\frac{\partial}{\partial\theta}
(\alpha+\beta\theta)=\beta.$ Für zwei Variablen wählen wir linksseitige Ableitungen und behalten die kanonische Reihenfolge $\theta_1\theta_2$ bei: $\begin{aligned}\frac{\partial^L f}{\partial\theta_1}
&=\beta_1+\gamma\theta_2,\\
\frac{\partial^L f}{\partial\theta_2}
&=\beta_2-\gamma\theta_1.\end{aligned}$ Das Minuszeichen in der zweiten Zeile entsteht, weil die ungerade Ableitung an $\theta_1$ vorbeimuss, bevor sie nach $\theta_2$ ableitet.

zh-Hant:
對單一變數，定義 $\frac{\partial}{\partial\theta}\alpha=0,
\qquad
\frac{\partial}{\partial\theta}\theta=1,$ 使得 $\frac{\partial}{\partial\theta}
(\alpha+\beta\theta)=\beta.$ 對兩個變數，採用左導數，並保持標準順序$\theta_1\theta_2$： $\begin{aligned}\frac{\partial^L f}{\partial\theta_1}
&=\beta_1+\gamma\theta_2,\\
\frac{\partial^L f}{\partial\theta_2}
&=\beta_2-\gamma\theta_1.\end{aligned}$ 第二行的負號來自奇導數必須先越過$\theta_1$，才能對$\theta_2$微分。

ko:
변수가 하나일 때 다음과 같이 정의한다: $\frac{\partial}{\partial\theta}\alpha=0,
\qquad
\frac{\partial}{\partial\theta}\theta=1,$ 그러면 $\frac{\partial}{\partial\theta}
(\alpha+\beta\theta)=\beta.$ 변수가 둘일 때는 왼쪽 미분을 택하고 표준 순서 $\theta_1\theta_2$를 유지하면 $\begin{aligned}\frac{\partial^L f}{\partial\theta_1}
&=\beta_1+\gamma\theta_2,\\
\frac{\partial^L f}{\partial\theta_2}
&=\beta_2-\gamma\theta_1.\end{aligned}$ 둘째 줄의 마이너스 부호는 홀수 미분 연산자가 $\theta_1$를 지나 $\theta_2$를 미분해야 해서 생긴다.

vi:
Đối với một biến, định nghĩa $\frac{\partial}{\partial\theta}\alpha=0,
\qquad
\frac{\partial}{\partial\theta}\theta=1,$ để cho $\frac{\partial}{\partial\theta}
(\alpha+\beta\theta)=\beta.$ Với hai biến, chọn đạo hàm trái và giữ thứ tự chuẩn tắc $\theta_1\theta_2$: $\begin{aligned}\frac{\partial^L f}{\partial\theta_1}
&=\beta_1+\gamma\theta_2,\\
\frac{\partial^L f}{\partial\theta_2}
&=\beta_2-\gamma\theta_1.\end{aligned}$ Dấu trừ ở dòng thứ hai xuất hiện vì đạo hàm lẻ phải đi qua $\theta_1$ trước khi đạo hàm $\theta_2$.

ru:
Для одной переменной определим $\frac{\partial}{\partial\theta}\alpha=0,
\qquad
\frac{\partial}{\partial\theta}\theta=1,$ так что $\frac{\partial}{\partial\theta}
(\alpha+\beta\theta)=\beta.$ Для двух переменных выберем левые производные и будем сохранять канонический порядок $\theta_1\theta_2$: $\begin{aligned}\frac{\partial^L f}{\partial\theta_1}
&=\beta_1+\gamma\theta_2,\\
\frac{\partial^L f}{\partial\theta_2}
&=\beta_2-\gamma\theta_1.\end{aligned}$ Знак минус во второй строке возникает потому, что нечётная производная должна пройти через $\theta_1$, прежде чем продифференцировать $\theta_2$.

